title WF05 Credit top-up via PayOS (a) - payment link
|User|
start
:Open credits tab and\nenter top-up amount;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Amount >= 10,000 VND and\nmultiple of 100?) then ([yes])
else ([no])
  :Show error;
  stop
endif
:Create PayOS payment link\nand a pending order;
|User|
:Confirm and go to\nPayOS checkout;
